          "id": 1930463760,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Example capture file:\n\n[preshared_communication.pcapng](/uploads/bfff063b3086b5e8ec412b03734ae53c/preshared_communication.pcapng)\n\nConfigure with pre-shared key id equal to `0` and secret equal to `gveXKVIh8qkh9FldMmIvcmC4krUhka9F8ocUtEMAkmTN8Kl`.\n\n![configure_key](/uploads/d231548714ea2bfa69d5496bb3312383/configure_key.png)\n\n![decoded](/uploads/baf0bad6a8d50aa3b18034a65f10a7eb/decoded.png)",
